in{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨2,0,1⟩ & =5 \\\\ 2x+z & =5 \\\\ 2x+z-5 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388371 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388372 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388373 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388374 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388375 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1041 "selection" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388371 13194139536195 true] [17592186388370 1110 #uuid "00a3b9d1-0ad0-5d22-99a4-a2440d1b0130" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388371 1034 "2x+z-5=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388371 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388371 1111 #uuid "8101687d-7ccb-52d3-a02f-0c5359b90ea1" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388372 1034 "x+y+3z-5=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388372 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388372 1111 #uuid "59f14b86-3fe8-52f4-b9c8-dbbfe3669e38" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388373 1034 "2x+2y+z-5=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388373 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388373 1111 #uuid "8b2fcc60-90c3-5609-bfed-6442fa453c39" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388374 1034 "x+3z-5=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388374 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388374 1111 #uuid "cf820b1a-e763-5ae9-a87b-16e8093772f7" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388375 1034 "2x-5y+z=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388375 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388375 1111 #uuid "168ede94-970d-55eb-9df2-b1ae2213784b" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388376 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388377 13194139536195 true] [17592186388376 1089 "q-70805" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388376 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536195 true] [17592186388376 1100 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(-1,1,-2)$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n=i+j+3k.$" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388376 1113 #uuid "c9388b78-08c8-50f9-9be6-ffeb2395d72f" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388376 1145 "First, we note that the position vector of the point $P$ is $p=⟨-1,1,-2⟩$ and the normal vector of the plane is $n=⟨1,1,3⟩.$\n\nUsing the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,1,3⟩ & =⟨-1,1,-2⟩\\cdot ⟨1,1,3⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,1,3⟩ & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨1,1,3⟩ & =-6 \\\\ x+y+3z & =-6 \\\\ x+y+3z+6 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388378 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388379 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388380 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388381 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388382 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1041 "selection" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388380 13194139536195 true] [17592186388377 1110 #uuid "bfd31e76-57ed-504c-b930-3502ff9a51eb" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388378 1034 "x-y+2z-5=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388378 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388378 1111 #uuid "97db5536-94e6-57c9-932b-b7d1dd8ab302" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388379 1034 "x+y+3z+8=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388379 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388379 1111 #uuid "44dca2f2-e0dc-50b3-8855-d2bc9b7b3045" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388380 1034 "x+y+3z+6=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388380 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388380 1111 #uuid "d9153e5f-3cdd-5dc5-8a10-ed35868113d1" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388381 1034 "-x+y-2z+6=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388381 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388381 1111 #uuid "eaf6de68-de37-58f0-a72d-0d0b902321de" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388382 1034 "x+y+3z+5=0" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388382 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536195 true] [17592186388382 1111 #uuid "862e7072-e0fd-5084-b3f3-06155608d474" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388383 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388384 13194139536195 true] [17592186388383 1089 "q-70833" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388383 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536195 true] [17592186388383 1100 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(2,0,-3)$ and is parallel to the vectors ${v}_{1}=⟨-3,2,0⟩$ and ${v}_{2}=⟨0,0,1⟩.$" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388383 1113 #uuid "6822fa82-3903-5a2d-867d-04dce53d85c4" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388383 1145 "First, we note that the position vector of the point $P$ is $p=⟨2,0,-3⟩.$\n\nNow, we need to find the normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & ={v}_{1}\\times {v}_{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =2i+3j \\\\  & =⟨2,3,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨2,3,0⟩ & =⟨2,0,-3⟩\\cdot ⟨2,3,0⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨2,3,0⟩ & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨2,3,0⟩ & =4 \\\\ 2x+3y & =4 \\\\ 2x+3y-4 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536195 true] [17592186388384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388385 13194139